   "design": "Truck loads and equipment hours come from the fleet dispatch and weighbridge records, and supervisors fill in shift reports on a tablet form, so a production dashboard shows rates against plan per shift and per machine, instead of the engineer collecting paper reports, typing them and computing rates. The dashboard does not rate individual operators. Walking the workings, discussions, the note, the check and sending stay with the engineer.",
   "previous_blocker": "Production figures were collected on paper and typed into a spreadsheet.",
   "enabler_now": "Fleet dispatch records, tablet shift reports and a production dashboard.",
   "still_hard": "Underground areas without dispatch coverage.",
   "human_edge": "Seeing why a face is behind plan.",
   "ambition": {
    "kind": "none",
    "what": ""
   },
   "altitude": "Less collecting and typing; finding causes stays.",
   "reach": [
    {
     "role": "shift supervisors",
     "task": "Report shifts",
     "learn": "Whether the tablet form is quicker than paper."
    }
   ],
   "build_days": {
    "coding": "0-1",
    "integration": "1-2",
