    }
   ],
   "assumptions": [
    "Boundary: monitoring production rates; typing actual progress into the schedule is part of preparing schedules and estimates (task 3565), which the sibling covers.",
    "Input contract: about 80% of tonnes and hours are recorded by dispatch or weighbridge; s3 is priced at that share and keeps 20 for drilling metres and areas without coverage; s2 keeps 20; s4 keeps 30 for reading the dashboard. The supervisor's form time is shown in s1.",
    "Rates per operator would need works council consent; the dashboard shows shifts and machines only.",
    "The means prior puts 55% in person; the steps show 59%, because walking the workings and discussions dominate."
   ],
